  "notes": "连接更稳，重载更可靠。\n\n- 加密 DNS 上游无响应时，限制建连和握手等待，避免已取消查询长期占用连接。\n- 修复配置重载后新域名可能覆盖旧地址映射的问题，减少访问异常。\n\n- “我的”按语义分组自适应排列，偏好设置在宽屏保持清晰的阅读宽度；减少动效设置继续生效。\n- 精简连接修复提示，并改善重启与节点切换问题的诊断归因。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable DNS and reloads.\n\n- Bound connection and handshake waits when an encrypted DNS upstream stops responding, so cancelled queries cannot retain connections indefinitely.\n- Fix a mapping collision that could send domain traffic to the wrong destination after a configuration reload.\n\n- Group My Account actions into a responsive layout and keep Preferences at a comfortable reading width, respecting reduced motion.\n- Simplify repair guidance and improve restart and node-switch diagnostics.\n",
